{"instruction": "Aap kya kar sakte ho?", "input": "", "output": "Main Quen AI hoon. Main English, Hindi, aur Hinglish mein help kar sakta hoon. Main general questions, coding help, aur learning support de sakta hoon."}
{"instruction": "Ek simple Python program likho jo user ka naam lega aur greeting dega.", "input": "", "output": "```python\nname = input('Apna naam likho: ')\nprint(f'Namaste, {name}! Aapka swagat hai.')\n```"}
{"instruction": "Hindi mein explain karo ki Python kya hai.", "input": "", "output": "Python ek powerful programming language hai jo easy syntax ke karan beginners ke liye bahut aasan hai. Iska use web apps, automation, AI, data science, aur scripting mein hota hai."}
{"instruction": "Agar user code me error diya hai toh uska reason batana.", "input": "User ne code me NameError diya hai.", "output": "NameError ka matlab aap variable ya function ko define karne se pehle use kar rahe ho. Check karo ki variable ka naam sahi hai aur usse pehle assign kiya gaya hai."}
{"instruction": "Hinglish mein answer do: AI project kaise start karna chahiye?", "input": "", "output": "Sabse pehle ek clear use case define karo. Fir dataset collect karo. Phir model choose karo, training pipeline set karo, aur ek simple UI bana ke test karo. Start small, then improve step by step."}
{"instruction": "Ek beginner-friendly Python project idea batao.", "input": "", "output": "Ek simple To-Do List app banana ek accha beginner project hai. Aap file handling ya SQLite ke saath tasks add, delete, aur mark complete kar sakte ho."}
{"instruction": "Image generation ke liye shuruat kaise karni chahiye?", "input": "", "output": "Sabse pehle text-to-image models jaise Stable Diffusion ko samjho. Fir prompts ko experiment karo, model checkpoint choose karo, aur output quality improve karne ke liye prompt engineering use karo."}
{"instruction": "English: Explain what a chatbot is.", "input": "", "output": "A chatbot is a software application that can interact with users through text or voice. It uses rules, machine learning, or large language models to understand queries and generate useful responses."}
{"instruction": "Hindi mein machine learning aur AI ka basic difference samjhao.", "input": "", "output": "AI ek broad field hai jisme machines ko intelligent behavior dena hota hai. Machine learning AI ka ek subset hai jisme systems data se patterns seekh kar decisions karte hain."}
{"instruction": "Aap user ko coding sikha sakte ho kaise?", "input": "", "output": "Haan, main basics se start karke concepts simple examples ke saath explain kar sakta hoon, logic build karne mein help kar sakta hoon, aur code ke step-by-step analysis kar sakta hoon."}
